  "operatorObservations": [
    "The fresh dedicated muted browser reached the original main menu and accepted a QA name before any save data was supplied.",
    "The native Zombotany family showed its original first card, original locked second slot and distinct three-mushroom night card, with centered footer controls and no card tips.",
    "Six original plants were chosen through the native chooser. Sun-shroom and Puff-shroom were planted in bottom-row cells1,4 and2,4; the bank changed from50 to25 sun and the speed label changed to2x.",
    "Native Leave Game saved the board. Reload and Continue in the same browser restored the same two bottom-row plants,25 sun and2x, without importing or exporting that board.",
    "The actual pre-award native save-freeze checkpoint was imported through the reload save controls. Continue immediately restored the visibly frozen night lawn, mushroom-headed zombies and original HUD.",
    "Every successful DOM inspection showed muted audio. Chrome used --mute-audio throughout, no trophy was collected and no browser win was earned. No browser timing or GPU measurement was made.",
    "The immediate wait and inspection after the first navigation reported a transient inactive page. The next ordinary DOM inspection recovered before native game inputs; both errors remain in the action transcript."
  ],
